{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e00d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a075ff-68a1-7c53-bd42-f28c0c61d002"},"sequence":3681,"recorded_at":1780531400007357,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01319f54-880e-4865-b5c8-fc6dd7d16451","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"01319f54-880e-4865-b5c8-fc6dd7d16451","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01319f54-880e-4865-b5c8-fc6dd7d16451"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"358c4d83-311b-4832-b746-28175dbd2736"},"task_id":"358c4d83-311b-4832-b746-28175dbd2736","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"358c4d83-311b-4832-b746-28175dbd2736","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 6-8\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-## 2026-09-06\n-\n-### 1035 — Directory-node leaf round-2 rework: rev1 B1/B2/B3 closed, 185-mutant battery\n+## 2026-09-06\n+\n+### 1347 — Shared-environment boundary leaf: one library plus fail-closed agreement battery\n+- SCOPE: TASK-260830-3bkz0c (third/final leaf of STORY-260830-3drr2m). New package `internal/environ` (decode.go, tuple.go, observation.go, doc.go): single strict-frame decoder with string-walk surrogate semantics, rune measure, env-id/SemVer/arch grammars, exact six-member Tuple, §10.8.1 Environment Observation reusing the tuple model. Battery: census, frame/measure/tuple/identity agreement, observation. Frozen `sessadapter`/`dirnode` production untouched. Commit afdba1d (signed), PR #35 published.\n+- FINDING: sessadapter+dirnode raw-scan surrogate gates REFUSE wire bodies carrying literal backslash-u text (`cursor` value `\\ud800` text) while environ+provhost+canonicaljson string-walk gates ACCEPT — proven via DecodeTuple/CheckScanRequest/Canonicalize. sessadapter `TestSurrogateGateAgreesWithCanonicalJSON` is one-directional (`!localRefuses && sharedRefuses`) and hides exactly this class. Ledgered in frame_agreement_test.go; unifying the frozen scanners is the recorded follow-up.\n+- FINDING: truncated/malformed escapes refuse at the surrogate arm (raw scan) vs the syntax arm (string walk); wrong identity schema/version refuses at the member arm (provhost) vs the dispatch registry (canonicaljson). Same verdicts, different arms — ledgered per-judge, not papered over.\n+- FINDING: battery caught its author's parity error — run-3 backslashes (`\\\\\\ud800`) are a real lone escape (odd runs escape, even runs quote), not divergence; row corrected to all-refuse before green.\n+- EVIDENCE: attached TASK-260830-3bkz0c_boundary.md (7/7 AC rows with call sites) + TASK-260830-3bkz0c_mutation-log.md. Narrowing mutants 6/6 killed (N1/N2/N3/N4/N6 + token-preserving T1 raw-scan rewrite with census still green); D1 delete-only killed, scored as existence only. Tree sha-verified identical post-battery.\n+- GATES: `go test ./... -count=1` exit 0 (19 pkgs), environ `-race` exit 0, cover 76.1%, `go vet ./...` + `GOOS=windows go vet ./...` exit 0, gofmt clean, `tracecheck` exit 0 (unchanged), catalog generate no-diff, `go build ./...` exit 0.\n+- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off with CR published (review/landing are orchestrator steps).\n+\n+### 1035 — Directory-node leaf round-2 rework: rev1 B1/B2/B3 closed, 185-mutant battery\n"}}}
